{"isprs_int_j_geo_inf": "ISPRS Int. J. Geo-Inf. is an international, peer-reviewed, open access academic journal dedicated to geo-information science. It publishes research articles, reviews, technical notes, and scholarly content on topics such as geographic information systems, remote sensing, spatial data analysis, and geospatial technologies. The journal serves as a platform for disseminating innovative research and developments in the field of geo-information science, including remote sensing, photogrammetry, and spatial information science."},
{"isprs_int_j_geo_inf__year__2021": "The predicate 'year' or \"year\" consistently indicates the specific year in which a particular volume or issue of a journal was published, providing a temporal context for the research or articles presented within that volume or issue."},
