{"internet": "The Internet is a global network of interconnected computers and servers that allows for the sharing of information and communication across vast distances."},
{"internet__development__rapid": "The development of the Internet refers to the continuous evolution and expansion of its infrastructure, technologies, and applications, enabling more efficient and widespread communication and information exchange."},
