{"multimodal_messages__purpose__informing_others_about_disasters": "The purpose of multimodal messages in the context of natural disasters is to convey critical and timely information. This includes details about the condition and situation of the disaster, such as infrastructure damage, casualties, and help requests."},
{"informing_others_about_disasters": "Informing others about disasters involves sharing essential information through multimodal messages on social media. This information is vital for governments and humanitarian organizations to evaluate and respond to disasters more effectively, enabling quicker and more efficient disaster management."},
{"multimodal_messages__content__critical_information_such_as_infrastructure_damage_casualties_and_help_requests": "The content of multimodal messages during disasters includes essential details that help in assessing the impact and needs arising from the event. This information is crucial for effective disaster management and response."},
{"critical_information_such_as_infrastructure_damage_casualties_and_help_requests": "Critical information such as infrastructure damage, casualties, and help requests are vital components of multimodal messages posted during disasters. This data aids governments and humanitarian organizations in making informed decisions and providing timely assistance."},
