{"governments_and_humanitarian_organizations__ability__to_evaluate_and_respond_to_disasters_more_quickly_and_efficiently": "The ability refers to the capability or skill that governments and humanitarian organizations possess to effectively utilize information from the Internet, particularly from social media, to enhance their response to disasters and emergencies."},
