{"to_discover_and_classify_disaster_related_images_from_social_media": "To discover and classify disaster-related images from social media involves the process of identifying and categorizing images that are relevant to disaster situations among the vast amount of content available on social media platforms. This task is crucial for extracting actionable information during emergencies."},
{"social_media__content__a_lot_of_irrelevant_and_misleading_information": "The term \"content\" in this context refers to the various types of information and media that users post on social media platforms. This can include text-based posts, images, videos, and other forms of digital media that users share to communicate with others or express themselves."},
