{"we": "The subject \"we\" refers to the authors or researchers conducting the experiments and evaluations using the CrisisMMD dataset. They are the ones implementing the data fusion model framework.|Here is another description: The subject \"we\" refers to the researchers or analysts working with the CrisisMMD dataset, specifically focusing on the experimental data related to natural disaster events.|Here is another description: The subject \"we\" refers to the researchers or team involved in conducting the study or experiment described in the context. They are the ones who observed and analyzed the data presented in Figure 4.|Here is another description: The subject refers to the authors or researchers who conducted the study involving the training of a multimodal model. They are the ones who made decisions regarding the parameters of the training process."},
