{"pretrained_vgg16_and_fasttext": "The object \"pretrained VGG16 and FastText\" refers to the specific models that were utilized. VGG16 is a convolutional neural network used for image classification, and FastText is a library for efficient text classification and representation learning using word embeddings."},
{"pretrained_vgg16": "The pretrained VGG16 is a deep convolutional neural network that has been pre-trained on a large dataset, making it capable of recognizing a wide range of image features without needing to be trained from scratch."},
{"pretrained_vgg16__to_extract__features_from_images": "The action of using pretrained VGG16 to extract involves deploying the pre-trained model to analyze and identify distinct features within images, leveraging its learned capabilities to enhance image understanding and classification tasks."},
{"features_from_images": "Features from images refer to the distinct characteristics and patterns within images that are identified and extracted by the pretrained VGG16 model, which are essential for tasks like image classification and data fusion."},
{"fasttext__to_extract__features_from_text": "The action \"to extract\" in this context refers to the process of deriving meaningful information or features from a given input, in this case, text. FastText is utilized to perform this extraction by transforming raw text into a numerical representation that can be used for further analysis or machine learning tasks."},
{"features_from_text": "Features from text refer to the numerical representations or embeddings derived from textual data. These features capture various aspects of the text, such as word meanings, context, and syntactic relationships, which can be used as input for machine learning models to perform tasks like classification, clustering, or information retrieval."},
{"image_features": "The image features refer to the distinct characteristics and attributes extracted from images, which are essential for tasks like image classification and recognition. These features are typically derived using sophisticated algorithms and neural network architectures."},
{"image_features__were_retrieved__by_the_last_two_layers_of_the_fully_connected_layer_of_the_vgg16_network": "The phrase \"were retrieved\" indicates the process by which image features were obtained or extracted. In this context, it signifies that the image features were specifically drawn out using a particular method or layer within a neural network."},
{"by_the_last_two_layers_of_the_fully_connected_layer_of_the_vgg16_network": "The last two layers of the fully connected layer of the VGG16 network represent a specific part of the VGG16 architecture, a deep convolutional neural network. These layers are responsible for performing high-level reasoning and classification tasks after the convolutional and pooling layers have extracted and processed the initial features from the input images."},
{"textual_features__were_extracted__from_the_word_embeddings_that_had_been_trained_by_fasttext": "The predicate \"were extracted\" indicates the process by which textual features were obtained. This process involved using a pre-trained model to analyze and derive meaningful representations from the text data."},
{"from_the_word_embeddings_that_had_been_trained_by_fasttext": "The word embeddings trained by FastText represent a method of converting text into numerical form, capturing the semantic meaning and context of words. These embeddings serve as the source from which textual features are extracted for further processing and classification within the data fusion model."},
{"isprs_int_j_geo_inf__page__4_of_16": "The predicate \"page\" indicates the specific location within the document where certain content can be found, helping readers navigate to the relevant section of the publication."},
