{"multimodal_fusion_classification_model": "The multimodal fusion classification model is a sophisticated system designed to integrate multiple types of data for enhanced classification tasks. It utilizes a combination of features through a concatenating operation and employs a series of fully connected layers followed by a SoftMax layer to achieve the final classification."},
