{"text_messages": "Text messages in this context are the textual content of tweets posted on Twitter during natural disaster events. These messages are part of the CrisisMMD dataset and are manually annotated for their relevance and content related to the disaster."},
{"a_pair_of_a_text_message_and_an_image": "A pair of a text message and an image refers to a combination of textual content and visual content within the CrisisMMD dataset. This pairing represents individual tweets collected during major natural disaster events, where each tweet may contain one text message and potentially multiple images."},
