{"the_images_and_text_messages_with_the_same_label_as_the_experimental_data": "The object \"the images and text messages with the same label as the experimental data\" describes the specific subset of the CrisisMMD dataset that the researchers are focusing on. This subset includes only those data points where both the image and the accompanying text message have been annotated with the same label, ensuring consistency and relevance for the experimental tasks."},
