{"affected_individuals": "\"Affected individuals\" refers to people who have been impacted by a disaster, as categorized in the CrisisMMD dataset under Task 2. This category includes those directly affected by the event, such as those who have suffered injuries, fatalities, or are reported missing or found."},
{"affected_individuals__were_combined_with__injured_or_dead_people_and_missing_or_found_people": "The predicate \"were combined with\" indicates that in the CrisisMMD dataset, certain categories were merged to create a more streamlined dataset for analysis. This combination was necessary due to the low number of pairs of text messages and images in these specific categories."},
{"injured_or_dead_people_and_missing_or_found_people": "\"Injured or dead people\" and \"Missing or found people\" are specific categories within the CrisisMMD dataset under Task 2 that detail the status of individuals affected by a disaster. These categories were combined with \"Affected individuals\" to form a unified category for the purpose of simplifying the dataset and improving the efficiency of analysis."},
{"infrastructure_and_utility_damage": "\"Infrastructure and utility damage\" refers to the category within the CrisisMMD dataset that includes tweets and images depicting damage to infrastructure and utilities during natural disasters."},
