{"fc_num_classes": "FC-Num_Classes refers to the parameter size in the last layer of the fully connected layer in the image feature extractor module, which is part of a convolutional neural network (CNN) based on the VGG16 model. This parameter is crucial for determining the output dimensions of the network, aligning with the specific classification tasks it is designed to perform."},
