{"weights_from_the_vgg16_model": "The weights from the VGG16 model represent the parameters learned during the training of the VGG16 convolutional neural network. These weights are used in transfer learning to speed up the convergence of the current model by leveraging the knowledge gained from the pre-trained VGG16 model."},
