{"image_features_based_on_a_visual_geometry_group_network_vgg_framework": "Image features based on a visual geometry group network (VGG) framework refer to the specific characteristics and patterns extracted from images using the VGG network, a deep learning model known for its effectiveness in image recognition tasks."},
{"textual_feature_extractor": "The textual feature extractor is a component within a multimodal fusion method designed to classify disaster images. It is responsible for processing and extracting meaningful information from text data.|Here is another description: The textual feature extractor is one of the three modules in the multimodal classification model, responsible for processing and extracting features from textual data."},
{"textual_feature_extractor__extracts__textual_features_using_the_fasttext_framework_and_by_choosing_word_embedding": "The predicate \"extracts\" indicates the action performed by the textual feature extractor. It involves analyzing text data to derive significant features that can be used in further processing or classification tasks."},
{"textual_features_using_the_fasttext_framework_and_by_choosing_word_embedding": "Textual features are the meaningful attributes or characteristics extracted from text data. In this context, these features are obtained using the FastText framework, which is a library for efficient text classification and representation learning, and by selecting appropriate word embeddings that capture the semantic meaning of words."},
