{"multimodal_fusion_module__uses__three_fully_connected_layers_and_one_softmax_layer_to_complete_the_final_classification_task": "The predicate \"uses\" indicates the specific architecture and layers employed by the multimodal fusion module to perform its function. This involves the application of certain neural network layers to process and combine the multimodal data effectively."},
