{"image4act_an_end_to_end_social_media_image_processing_system": "Image4Act is an end-to-end social media image processing system created by Alam et al. in 2017. Its purpose is to collect, de-noise, and categorize image content from social media to assist humanitarian organizations in gaining situational awareness and facilitating relief operations during disasters."},
{"image4act": "Image4Act is an end-to-end social media image processing system developed by Alam et al. in 2017. It is designed to collect, de-noise, and categorize image content posted on social media platforms."},
{"image4act__helps__humanitarian_organizations_gain_sa_and_launch_relief_operations": "The predicate \"helps\" indicates that Image4Act provides assistance or support. In this context, it specifically aids in the process of gaining situational awareness and launching relief operations for humanitarian organizations."},
{"humanitarian_organizations_gain_sa_and_launch_relief_operations": "Humanitarian organizations are entities dedicated to providing aid and assistance in times of crisis or disaster. Gaining situational awareness (SA) involves understanding the current state of a disaster, which is crucial for making informed decisions and launching effective relief operations."},
{"zohaib_et_al": "Zohaib et al. refers to a group of researchers who have contributed to the field of disaster data analysis, specifically focusing on the use of image data for sentiment analysis in disaster scenarios."},
