{"a_context_aware_data_fusion_method_for_disaster_image_retrieval_from_social_media": "A context-aware data-fusion method for disaster image retrieval from social media is a technique that combines different types of data (such as images and text) to improve the accuracy and effectiveness of retrieving disaster-related images from social media platforms. This method takes into account the context in which the data is posted, which helps in better understanding and classifying the information."},
