{"crisismmd": "CrisisMMD is a specialized dataset designed for research and analysis of social media content during natural disasters. It focuses on collecting and annotating tweets that are relevant to major disaster events.|Here is another description: CrisisMMD is a specialized multimodal dataset that includes Twitter data with spatiotemporal features, specifically curated to capture information related to major natural disaster events."},
