{"data__are_annotated_with__three_types_of_labels": "The phrase \"are annotated with\" describes the process by which the tweets in the dataset are systematically categorized and labeled according to predefined classification tasks. This annotation process helps in organizing and analyzing the data effectively."},
{"three_types_of_labels": "The three types of labels represent the classification categories applied to the tweets in the dataset. These labels are derived from three distinct classification tasks aimed at evaluating the relevance, content, and severity of the information related to the natural disasters."},
