{"the_severity_of_the_damage_reported_shown_in_the_infrastructure_and_utility_damage_images": "The severity of the damage reported or shown in the \u201cInfrastructure and utility damage\u201d images refers to the degree of harm or destruction to infrastructure and utilities as depicted in the images, which is categorized into \"Severe damage,\" \"Mild damage,\" \"Little or no damage,\" and \"Don\u2019t know or can\u2019t judge.\""},
{"damage_severity_categories": "Damage severity categories are classifications used in the CrisisMMD dataset to assess the extent of damage reported or shown in images related to infrastructure and utility damage during natural disasters."},
