{"severe_damage_mild_damage_little_or_no_damage_and_don_t_know_or_can_t_judge": "The objects \"Severe damage\", \"Mild damage\", \"Little or no damage\", and \"Don\u2019t know or can\u2019t judge\" are the specific categories within the damage severity classification. These categories help in quantifying the level of damage observed in the images, with \"Severe damage\" indicating significant destruction, \"Mild damage\" suggesting some level of impact, \"Little or no damage\" implying minimal or no noticeable harm, and \"Don\u2019t know or can\u2019t judge\" reflecting uncertainty or inability to assess the damage."},
