{"500_size": "The 500 size refers to the adjusted parameter size in the second to last layer of the fully connected layer within the VGG16 model, which was modified from the original size of 1000 for improved performance in specific tasks.|Here is another description: The 500 size refers to the parameter size in the second to last layer of the fully connected layer within the image feature extractor module, which was adjusted from the original size of 1000."},
{"500_size__obtained__the_same_or_even_better_results_under_the_same_training_epochs": "The predicate 'obtained' signifies that the 500 size parameter setting was able to achieve certain results during the training process of the model."},
