{"images__size__not_uniform": "The size of the images indicates the dimensions or resolution of each image in the dataset. This predicate highlights a characteristic of the images that necessitates a preprocessing step\u2014cropping and resizing\u2014to ensure uniformity across the dataset for consistent model training."},
