{"images__need_to_be__cropped_and_resized": "The phrase \"need to be\" indicates a requirement or necessary action that must be taken on the subject images. In this context, it signifies that the images must undergo a specific transformation to meet the criteria for subsequent training processes."},
{"cropped_and_resized": "The object \"cropped and resized\" describes the specific actions that need to be performed on the images. Cropping involves trimming the images to remove unwanted areas, while resizing adjusts the dimensions to a uniform size, in this case, 224\u00d7224 pixels, to ensure consistency across the dataset for effective training."},
